README.md:26:### An institutional-grade trading journal built for serious traders.
README.md:36:Most trading journals are either too simple to be useful or locked behind expensive subscriptions. QuantEdge is built differently — it is a complete trading process tool, not just a P&L logger.
README.md:38:**Your data stays yours.** Everything runs locally on your machine using SQLite. No cloud sync, no user accounts, no telemetry, no third-party data transfers of any kind. Your trade history, journal entries, screenshots, and performance data never leave your machine.
README.md:40:**Built for serious traders.** Multi-account support, real equity curve tracking from your actual starting balance, institutional-grade risk metrics, execution quality analysis, behavioral pattern detection, a prop-firm evaluation tracker with pass-rate simulation, a recommendations engine that names the figure behind every finding, a strategy playbook with live performance stats, position sizing, hour-of-day heatmaps, and a full rich text journal with templates.
README.md:59:Day-grouped trade cards with journal previews, tags, and quick delete.
